# Character Manager

## Description
This Python script (`char_manager.py`) provides functionality to manage characters, such as creating, updating, and deleting character profiles. It is part of the NH_CP2 project.

## Features
- Create new characters 🆕
- Edit existing characters ✏️
- Delete characters ❌
- View character details 👀

## Installation
Ensure you have Python installed. No additional stuff is required.

## Usage
Run the code after installing Python.
Follow the on-screen prompts to manage characters.
